/borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/v1712572173/sapphire2024/macos-icon.svg><h3 class=content-title>macOS</h3></div><div><img src=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/v1712572173/sapphire2024/windows-icon.svg><h3 class=content-title>Windows</h3></div><div><img src=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/v1712572173/sapphire2024/linux-icon.svg><h3 class=content-title>Linux</h3></div></div></div></section><style>.standalone-block.white{background:#fff}.standalone-block h2.content-title{text-align:center;margin-bottom:0;padding-bottom:80px}.standalone-block .row-container{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:160px}.standalone-block .row-container div{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center;position:relative}.standalone-block .row-container div:after{content:'';width:1px;background:#e5e5e6;height:100%;position:absolute;right:-80px;top:0}.standalone-block .row-container div:last-of-type:after{display:none}.standalone-block .row-container div h3{margin-bottom:0}@media(max-width:930px){.standalone-block .row-container{gap:80px}.standalone-block .row-container div:after{right:-40px}}@media(max-width:800px){.standalone-block h2.content-title{padding-bottom:40px;font-size:30px!important;font-style:normal;font-weight:600;line-height:36px}.standalone-block .row-container{gap:80px}.standalone-block .row-container div:after{left:50%;right:0;transform:translateX(-50%);width:100%;height:1px;bottom:-40px;top:auto}}@media(max-width:740px){.standalone-block.white{padding-top:80px;padding-bottom:40px}.standalone-block .row-container{flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.standalone-block .row-container div:after{right:-20px}.list-items .row-container{gap:24px;flex-direction:column}.list-items .row-container .left:after{display:none}.list-items .row-container .left,.list-items .row-container .right{width:100%}.standalone-block .row-container div{width:100%;justify-content:center}}</style><section class=system><div class=container><div class=system-container><h2 class=content-title>System requirements</h2><div class=wrap-system><div class=system-items><div class="row-system active"><div class=accordion-container data-title="Host Support"><div class="set active"><a href=# rel=nofollow data-img class="h3-content-title active">Host Support
<span><img decoding=async src='data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="25" height="24" viewBox="0 0 25 24" fill="none"><g clip-path="url(%23clip0_3722_33245)"><path d="M4.51406 17.5098L2.71311 15.7398L12.7862 5.83977L22.8594 15.7398L21.0584 17.5098L12.7862 9.37977L4.51406 17.5098Z" fill="%23000000"/></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_3722_33245"><rect width="24" height="24.4197" fill="white" transform="matrix(-4.44758e-08 -1 -1 4.29601e-08 25 24)"/></clipPath></defs></svg>'></span></a><div class=content-wrapper><div class=accordion-content><div><div class=items><ul class=body-default-new><li>Adobe After Effects</li><li>Adobe Photoshop</li><li>Autodesk Flame (OFX)</li><li>Blackmagic DaVinci Resolve (OFX)</li><li>VEGAS Pro (OFX)</li><li>Adobe Premiere Pro</li><li>Avid Media Composer</li><li>The Foundry’s Nuke (OFX)</li><li>Blackmagic Fusion Studio (OFX)</li></ul><div class=text-specs>For a full list of supported host versions and OS versions, <a href=/products/sapphire/supported-hosts/ target=_blank class=link>please click here.</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=row-system><div class=accordion-container data-title=MacOS><div class=set><a href=# rel=nofollow data-img=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/w_500,q_auto,f_auto,fl_lossy/v1712414923/sapphire2024/MacOs.png class=h3-content-title>MacOS
<span><img decoding=async src='data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="25" height="24" viewBox="0 0 25 24" fill="none"><g clip-path="url(%23clip0_3722_33245)"><path d="M4.51406 17.5098L2.71311 15.7398L12.7862 5.83977L22.8594 15.7398L21.0584 17.5098L12.7862 9.37977L4.51406 17.5098Z" fill="%23000000"/></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_3722_33245"><rect width="24" height="24.4197" fill="white" transform="matrix(-4.44758e-08 -1 -1 4.29601e-08 25 24)"/></clipPath></defs></svg>'></span></a><div class=content-wrapper><div class=accordion-content><div class=items><h6 class=content-title>OS Requirements</h6><ul class=body-default><li>Catalina 10.15 or higher</li><li>Note that ML tools featured in the integrated Mocha tracking and masking require Monterey 12.0 or higher</li></ul></div><div class=items><h6 class=content-title>Processor (CPU)</h6><ul class=body-default><li>Apple M-series or Intel processors</li></ul></div><div class=items><h6 class=content-title>System Memory (RAM)</h6><ul class=body-default><li>8 GB minimum, 16+ GB preferred</li></ul></div><div class=items><h6 class=content-title>Graphics Processor Unit (GPU)</h6><ul class=body-default><li>Native support for all Apple silicon integrated GPUs.</li><li>For more information on supported cards and drivers, <a href=https://support.borisfx.com/hc/en-us/articles/36208564852749-GPU-Acceleration-in-Sapphire-Tech-Specs target=_blank>please click here.</a></li></ul></div><div class=items><h6 class=content-title>Disk</h6><ul class=body-default><li>High-speed disk array or SSD storage</li></ul></div></div><div class=accordion-content-image><div class=image><img src=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/w_500,q_auto,f_auto,fl_lossy/v1712414923/sapphire2024/MacOs.png></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=row-system><div class=accordion-container data-title=Windows><div class=set><a href=# rel=nofollow data-img=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/w_500,q_auto,f_auto,fl_lossy/v1712414921/sapphire2024/Windows.png class=h3-content-title>Windows
<span><img decoding=async src='data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="25" height="24" viewBox="0 0 25 24" fill="none"><g clip-path="url(%23clip0_3722_33245)"><path d="M4.51406 17.5098L2.71311 15.7398L12.7862 5.83977L22.8594 15.7398L21.0584 17.5098L12.7862 9.37977L4.51406 17.5098Z" fill="%23000000"/></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_3722_33245"><rect width="24" height="24.4197" fill="white" transform="matrix(-4.44758e-08 -1 -1 4.29601e-08 25 24)"/></clipPath></defs></svg>'></span></a><div class=content-wrapper><div class=accordion-content><div class=items><h6 class=content-title>OS Requirements</h6><ul class=body-default><li>Windows 10 and Windows 11</li></ul></div><div class=items><h6 class=content-title>Processor (CPU)</h6><ul class=body-default><li>64-bit Intel or AMD CPU with four or more cores</li></ul></div><div class=items><h6 class=content-title>System Memory (RAM)</h6><ul class=body-default><li>8 GB minimum, 16+ GB preferred</li></ul></div><div class=items><h6 class=content-title>Graphics Processor Unit (GPU)</h6><ul class=body-default><li>Currently supported cards include NVIDIA Ampere, Ada Lovelace, Hopper, and Blackwell series.</li><li>Currently supported cards include the AMD Radeon™ PRO W6000, W7000, W,8000, W9000 Series, as well as the AMD Ryzen™ AI Max PRO series.</li><li>For more information on supported cards and drivers, <a href=https://support.borisfx.com/hc/en-us/articles/36208564852749-GPU-Acceleration-in-Sapphire-Tech-Specs target=_blank>please click here.</a></li></ul></div><div class=items><h6 class=content-title>Disk</h6><ul class=body-default><li>High-speed disk array or SSD storage</li></ul></div></div><div class=accordion-content-image><div class=image><img src=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/w_500,q_auto,f_auto,fl_lossy/v1712414921/sapphire2024/Windows.png></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=row-system><div class=accordion-container data-title=Linux><div class=set><a href=# rel=nofollow data-img=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/w_500,q_auto,f_auto,fl_lossy/v1712414923/sapphire2024/linux.png class=h3-content-title>Linux
<span><img decoding=async src='data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="25" height="24" viewBox="0 0 25 24" fill="none"><g clip-path="url(%23clip0_3722_33245)"><path d="M4.51406 17.5098L2.71311 15.7398L12.7862 5.83977L22.8594 15.7398L21.0584 17.5098L12.7862 9.37977L4.51406 17.5098Z" fill="%23000000"/></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_3722_33245"><rect width="24" height="24.4197" fill="white" transform="matrix(-4.44758e-08 -1 -1 4.29601e-08 25 24)"/></clipPath></defs></svg>'></span></a><div class=content-wrapper><div class=accordion-content><div class=items><h6 class=content-title>Operating System</h6><ul class=body-default><li>Red Hat Enterprise Linux 7-9, or a compatible Linux distribution such as Rocky Linux</li></ul></div><div class=items><h6 class=content-title>Processor (CPU)</h6><ul class=body-default><li>64-bit Intel or AMD CPU with four or more cores</li></ul></div><div class=items><h6 class=content-title>System Memory (RAM)</h6><ul class=body-default><li>8 GB minimum, 16+ GB preferred</li></ul></div><div class=items><h6 class=content-title>Graphics Processor (GPU)</h6><ul class=body-default><li>Currently supported cards include NVIDIA Ampere, Ada Lovelace, Hopper, and Blackwell series.</li><li>For more information on supported cards and drivers, <a href=https://support.borisfx.com/hc/en-us/articles/36208564852749-GPU-Acceleration-in-Sapphire-Tech-Specs target=_blank>please click here.</a></li></ul></div><div class=items><h6 class=content-title>Disk</h6><ul class=body-default><li>High-speed disk array or SSD storage</li></ul></div></div><div class=accordion-content-image><div class=image><img src=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/w_500,q_auto,f_auto,fl_lossy/v1712414923/sapphire2024/linux.png></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>$(document.body).on("click",".set > a",function(){let t=$(this),n=t.closest(".row-system"),s=t.closest(".set");return t.hasClass("active")?(t.removeClass("active"),n.removeClass("active"),s.removeClass("active")):(t.addClass("active"),n.addClass("active"),s.addClass("active")),!1})</script></div><div class=div-params data-href=whats-new><section class=whats-new-sapphire-cards><div class=container><div class=whats-new-sapphire-cards-inner><h2 class=content-title>What&rsquo;s New in Sapphire 2026.5</h2><div class=cards-grid><div class=card><h3 class=card-title>Advanced Defocus</h3><div class="card-content body-default">Recreates the subtle flaws and handcrafted character that give a real lens blur its unmistakable feel.</div></div><div class=card><h3 class=card-title>Texture Ridges</h3><div class="card-content body-default">Create flowing ridges and organic fractal textures from procedural noise.</div></div><div class=card><h3 class=card-title>Reimagined Glare</h3><div class="card-content body-default">Light that blooms, streaks, and shines with gorgeous intensity.</div></div><div class=card><h3 class=card-title>Updated Effect and Transition Builder</h3><div class="card-content body-default">Design custom effects and transitions with new tools, presets, and a faster, more intuitive workflow.</div></div><div class=card><h3 class=card-title>Pro Lens Flares</h3><div class="card-content body-default">Five new cinematic lens flares crafted for modern productions.</div></div><div class=card><h3 class=card-title>New and Updated Presets</h3><div class="card-content body-default">Includes 100+ new effect and transition presets for 2026.5.</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=sapphire-whats-new-features><div class=container><div class=feature-block><div class=feature-card><div class=feature-media><img src=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,fl_lossy,c_fill,w_1280,h_720/v1778842926/advanced-defocus_ugghgd.jpg alt="Sapphire Advanced Defocus" loading=lazy srcset="https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,fl_lossy,c_fill,w_768,h_432/v1778842926/advanced-defocus_ugghgd.jpg 768w, https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,fl_lossy,c_fill,w_1024,h_576/v1778842926/advanced-defocus_ugghgd.jpg 1024w, https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,fl_lossy,c_fill,w_1280,h_720/v1778842926/advanced-defocus_ugghgd.jpg 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 740px) 100vw, (max-width: 992px) 50vw, 638px">
<a class="play-button sapphire" data-fancybox href=https://youtu.be/rn-qeN2Jpw4 aria-label="Play video: Sapphire Advanced Defocus"></a></div><div class=feature-text><div class=tags><span class=tag>New</span>
<span class=tag>Version 2026.5</span></div><h3 class=feature-title>Sapphire Advanced Defocus</h3><p class=feature-subtitle>Real lens behavior. Beautiful optical imperfections.</p><div class=feature-content><p>Sapphire Advanced Defocus recreates the character, distortion, and cinematic defocus of real-world lenses. It builds upon a Rack Defocus foundation and includes a powerful new control set.</p><p>Advanced Defocus gives artists deep control over bokeh shape, cat's eye highlights, lens textures, chromatic aberration, and matte box simulation.</p><p>Quickly create pristine, modern glass or dirty, vintage optics with the unmistakable handcrafted quality of physical lenses.</p></div><a class=watch-button data-fancybox href=https://youtu.be/rn-qeN2Jpw4>Watch | 14:35</a></div></div><div class=sub-effects-grid><div class=sub-effect><div class="sub-effect-media has-compare"><a class=sub-effect-link data-compare-target=#sapphire-sub-effect-compare-0-0 href=javascript:; aria-label="Open before and after comparison for Cat's Eye Bokeh"><img src=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,fl_lossy,c_fill,w_1280,h_720/v1779132280/5ec26ec5dd58e593fc2edea41875c19719bd5959_akxas6.webp alt="Cat's Eye Bokeh" loading=lazy srcset="https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,fl_lossy,c_fill,w_768,h_432/v1779132280/5ec26ec5dd58e593fc2edea41875c19719bd5959_akxas6.webp 768w, https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,fl_lossy,c_fill,w_1024,h_576/v1779132280/5ec26ec5dd58e593fc2edea41875c19719bd5959_akxas6.webp 1024w, https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,fl_lossy,c_fill,w_1280,h_720/v1779132280/5ec26ec5dd58e593fc2edea41875c19719bd5959_akxas6.webp 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 740px) 100vw, (max-width: 1152px) 50vw, 532px">
<span class=sub-effect-zoom aria-hidden=true></span></a></div><div class=sub-effect-text><h3 class=sub-effect-title>Cat&rsquo;s Eye Bokeh</h3><div class=sub-effect-content>Recreate the stretched edge highlights and optical distortion found in real lenses shot wide open.</div></div><div id=sapphire-sub-effect-compare-0-0 class=sapphire-sub-effect-compare-wrap style=display:none><div class="twentytwenty-container sapphire-sub-effect-compare"><img src=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/q_auto,f_auto,fl_lossy/v1779270308/CatsEye_Before_y9g3pq.webp alt="Cat's Eye Bokeh – Before">
