<span class=sub-effect-zoom aria-hidden=true></span></a></div><div class=sub-effect-text><h3 class=sub-effect-title>Matte Box Artifacts</h3><div class=sub-effect-content>Simulate subtle highlight clipping and edge darkening caused by real on-set matte boxes.</div></div><div id=sapphire-sub-effect-compare-0-1 class=sapphire-sub-effect-compare-wrap style=display:none><div class="twentytwenty-container sapphire-sub-effect-compare"><img src=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/q_auto,f_auto,fl_lossy/v1779270309/MatteBox_ecwvtn.webp alt="Matte Box Artifacts – Before">
