<span class=sub-effect-zoom aria-hidden=true></span></a></div><div class=sub-effect-text><h3 class=sub-effect-title>Custom Lens Kernels</h3><div class=sub-effect-content>Design unique bokeh shapes using custom kernels, aperture controls, and blade notches.</div></div><div id=sapphire-sub-effect-compare-0-2 class=sapphire-sub-effect-compare-wrap style=display:none><div class="twentytwenty-container sapphire-sub-effect-compare"><img src=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/q_auto,f_auto,fl_lossy/v1779270309/CustomKernel_Before_fk0zjs.webp alt="Custom Lens Kernels – Before">
