<span class=sub-effect-zoom aria-hidden=true></span></a></div><div class=sub-effect-text><h3 class=sub-effect-title>Organic Lens Texture</h3><div class=sub-effect-content>Add dirt, noise, and surface imperfections.</div></div><div id=sapphire-sub-effect-compare-0-3 class=sapphire-sub-effect-compare-wrap style=display:none><div class="twentytwenty-container sapphire-sub-effect-compare"><img src=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/q_auto,f_auto,fl_lossy/v1779270308/LensTexture_Before_hwktck.webp alt="Organic Lens Texture – Before">
<img src=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/q_auto,f_auto,fl_lossy/v1779270308/LensTexture_After_emytmr.webp alt="Organic Lens Texture – After"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=feature-block><div class=feature-card><div class=feature-media><img src=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,fl_lossy,c_fill,w_1280,h_720/v1778842959/texture-ridges_ztowhk.jpg alt="Sapphire Texture Ridges" loading=lazy srcset="https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,fl_lossy,c_fill,w_768,h_432/v1778842959/texture-ridges_ztowhk.jpg 768w, https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,fl_lossy,c_fill,w_1024,h_576/v1778842959/texture-ridges_ztowhk.jpg 1024w, https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,fl_lossy,c_fill,w_1280,h_720/v1778842959/texture-ridges_ztowhk.jpg 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 740px) 100vw, (max-width: 992px) 50vw, 638px"></div><div class=feature-text><div class=tags><span class=tag>New</span>
<span class=tag>Version 2026.5</span></div><h3 class=feature-title>Sapphire Texture Ridges</h3><p class=feature-subtitle>Procedural peaks with striking detail.</p><div class=feature-content><p>S_TextureRidges is inspired by classic multi-fractal rendering techniques. It transforms sharp noise into smooth ridges using layered patterns packed with organic surface detail.</p><p>TextureRidge inverts and reshapes procedural noise patterns to create flowing peaks, animating formations, and rich textures that feel mathematical and natural.</p><p>Fine-tune octave scaling, speed, frequency, and contrast to create tiny surface details, aggressive abstract designs, or anything in between.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=feature-block><div class="feature-card flip"><div class=feature-media><img src=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,fl_lossy,c_fill,w_1280,h_720/v1778842955/reimagined-glare_mfchmi.jpg alt="Reimagined Sapphire Glare" loading=lazy srcset="https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,fl_lossy,c_fill,w_768,h_432/v1778842955/reimagined-glare_mfchmi.jpg 768w, https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,fl_lossy,c_fill,w_1024,h_576/v1778842955/reimagined-glare_mfchmi.jpg 1024w, https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,fl_lossy,c_fill,w_1280,h_720/v1778842955/reimagined-glare_mfchmi.jpg 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 740px) 100vw, (max-width: 992px) 50vw, 638px">
<a class="play-button sapphire" data-fancybox href=https://youtu.be/5zoLxXuTkIw aria-label="Play video: Reimagined Sapphire Glare"></a></div><div class=feature-text><div class=tags><span class=tag>New</span>
<span class=tag>Version 2026.5</span></div><h3 class=feature-title>Reimagined Sapphire Glare</h3><p class=feature-subtitle>A fresh take on a Sapphire classic.</p><div class=feature-content><p>Easily create cinematic light blooms, streaks, and rainbow halos. The redesigned S_Glare effect delivers smoother rendering, richer spectral color, and improved controls.</p><p>Generate everything from soft atmospheric glow to sharp sci-fi glares with enhanced highlight isolation, cleaner rays, and more natural falloff.</p><p>Optimized rendering controls balance quality and speed, while new styles expand the creative range far beyond traditional glare effects.</p></div><a class=watch-button data-fancybox href=https://youtu.be/5zoLxXuTkIw>Watch | 10:28</a></div></div></div><div class=feature-block><div class=feature-card><div class=feature-media><img src=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,fl_lossy,c_fill,w_1280,h_720/v1779137942/489b3b521a4b90b874b7930b2af84af38fcecb99_kn3zq5.webp alt="Advanced Presets in Builder" loading=lazy srcset="https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,fl_lossy,c_fill,w_768,h_432/v1779137942/489b3b521a4b90b874b7930b2af84af38fcecb99_kn3zq5.webp 768w, https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,fl_lossy,c_fill,w_1024,h_576/v1779137942/489b3b521a4b90b874b7930b2af84af38fcecb99_kn3zq5.webp 1024w, https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,fl_lossy,c_fill,w_1280,h_720/v1779137942/489b3b521a4b90b874b7930b2af84af38fcecb99_kn3zq5.webp 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 740px) 100vw, (max-width: 992px) 50vw, 638px">
<a class="play-button sapphire" data-fancybox href=https://youtu.be/EHU0Y5iYsvo aria-label="Play video: Advanced Presets in Builder"></a></div><div class=feature-text><div class=tags><span class=tag>New</span>
<span class=tag>Version 2026</span></div><h3 class=feature-title>Advanced Presets in Builder</h3><p class=feature-subtitle>Streamlined custom effects.</p><div class=feature-content>The updated Effect Builder delivers a streamlined, more intuitive interface that allows artists to create complex, layered effects and transitions faster and more easily. Builder’s dynamic workflow also adds greater artistic flexibility with new built-in Dots and Noise tools.</div><a class=watch-button data-fancybox href=https://youtu.be/EHU0Y5iYsvo>Watch | 7:08</a></div></div></div><div class=feature-block><div class="feature-card flip"><div class=feature-media><img src=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,fl_lossy,c_fill,w_1280,h_720/v1779138034/4fea9f030272f7d83e7fd934c372751c4a9b1077_1_ydtnjq.webp alt="Pro Lens Flares" loading=lazy srcset="https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,fl_lossy,c_fill,w_768,h_432/v1779138034/4fea9f030272f7d83e7fd934c372751c4a9b1077_1_ydtnjq.webp 768w, https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,fl_lossy,c_fill,w_1024,h_576/v1779138034/4fea9f030272f7d83e7fd934c372751c4a9b1077_1_ydtnjq.webp 1024w, https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,fl_lossy,c_fill,w_1280,h_720/v1779138034/4fea9f030272f7d83e7fd934c372751c4a9b1077_1_ydtnjq.webp 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 740px) 100vw, (max-width: 992px) 50vw, 638px">
<a class="play-button sapphire" data-fancybox href=https://youtu.be/Z_T1pE4VEpM aria-label="Play video: Pro Lens Flares"></a></div><div class=feature-text><div class=tags><span class=tag>New</span>
<span class=tag>Version 2026.5</span></div><h3 class=feature-title>Pro Lens Flares</h3><p class=feature-subtitle>Cinematic lens flares crafted for modern productions.</p><div class=feature-content><p>Sapphire's legendary lens flares expand with stunning new presets and enhanced creative controls designed by professional VFX artists.</p><p>The updated flare collection offers organic, richly detailed, dimensional production-ready optical effects — from cinematic haze to bold anamorphic streaks.</p></div><a class=watch-button data-fancybox href=https://youtu.be/Z_T1pE4VEpM>Watch | 12:15</a></div></div></div></div></section><script>(function(){if(typeof jQuery=="undefined")return;var e=jQuery;if(e(document).data("sapphire-sub-effect-compare-bound"))return;e(document).data("sapphire-sub-effect-compare-bound",!0);function t(t){for(var n=t.parent(".twentytwenty-wrapper");n.length;)n.before(t),n.remove(),n=t.parent(".twentytwenty-wrapper");t.find(".twentytwenty-overlay, .twentytwenty-handle, .twentytwenty-before-label, .twentytwenty-after-label, .twentytwenty-custom-abs").remove(),t.removeClass("twentytwenty-horizontal twentytwenty-vertical active"),t.css("height",""),t.find("img").each(function(){e(this).removeClass("twentytwenty-before twentytwenty-after").css("clip","")})}e(document).on("click.sapphireCompare","a.sub-effect-link[data-compare-target]",function(n){if(n.preventDefault(),typeof e.fancybox=="undefined")return;var s=e(this).attr("data-compare-target"),o=e(s);if(!o.length)return;e.fancybox.open({src:s,type:"inline"},{touch:!1,baseClass:"sapphire-compare-fancybox",afterShow:function(n,s){if(!s||!s.$content)return;var o=s.$content.find(".sapphire-sub-effect-compare").first();if(!o.length)return;t(o),typeof e.fn.twentytwenty=="function"&&o.twentytwenty({before_label:"Before",after_label:"After",need_custom:1,default_offset_pct:.5})}})})})()</script><style>.optics-gallery-features{width:100%;margin-bottom:80px;padding:20px 70px;box-sizing:border-box;gap:64px;displa