an data-index=12></span></div></div><div class=text-info><div class=top><h3 class=content-title>Hawk C-Series 50mm T2.2 @T3.2</h3></div><div class="text body-default">Captures the signature look of Hawk&rsquo;s iconic 2x anamorphic lenses with controlled horizontal blue streaks and a clean cinematic character. Famously reminiscent of the lenses used on Star Wars: Episode I &ndash; The Phantom Menace.</div></div></div><div class=swiper-slide><div class=image-block><div id=containerCompleteMemory class=twentytwenty-container><img data-title=Before data-content=Before src=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/v1779131872/memory-after_a2ff1a.webp class=first>
<img data-title=After data-content=After src=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/v1779131872/memory-before_rvzoxq.webp></div><div class=optics-gallery-features-arrow><div class=swiper-button-prev aria-label="Previous slide"><svg width="40" height="41" viewBox="0 0 40 41" fill="none"><rect width="40" height="40" rx="20" fill="#000" fill-opacity=".65"/><g clip-path="url(#clip0_22467_21493)"><path d="M24.6205 11.0916c-.489999999999998-.4945-1.28-.4945-1.77.0l-8.31 8.3862C14.1505 19.8714 14.1505 20.5072 14.5405 20.9007l8.31 8.3863C23.3405 29.7815 24.1305 29.7815 24.6205 29.287 25.1105 28.7925 25.1105 27.9952 24.6205 27.5008l-7.24-7.3166 7.25-7.3165C25.1105 12.3833 25.1105 11.576 24.6205 11.0916z" fill="#fff" fill-opacity=".6"/></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_22467_21493"><rect width="24" height="24.2202" fill="#fff" transform="translate(8 8.07422)"/></clipPath></defs></svg></div><div class=swiper-button-next aria-label="Next slide"><svg width="40" height="41" viewBox="0 0 40 41" fill="none"><rect width="40" height="40" rx="20" transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 40 0)" fill="#000" fill-opacity=".65"/><g clip-path="url(#clip0_22467_21500)"><path d="M15.3795 11.0916c.49-.4945 1.28-.4945 1.77.0l8.31 8.3862C25.8495 19.8714 25.8495 20.5072 25.4595 20.9007l-8.31 8.3863C16.6595 29.7815 15.8695 29.7815 15.3795 29.287c-.49-.494499999999999-.49-1.2918.0-1.7863l7.24-7.3165-7.25-7.3165C14.8895 12.3833 14.8895 11.576 15.3795 11.0916z" fill="#fff" fill-opacity=".6"/></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_22467_21500"><rect width="24" height="24.2202" fill="#fff" transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 32 8.07422)"/></clipPath></defs></svg></div></div><div class=optics-pagination><span data-index=0></span><span class=active data-index=1></span><span data-index=2></span><span data-index=3></span><span data-index=4></span><span data-index=5></span><span data-index=6></span><span data-index=7></span><span data-index=8></span><span data-index=9></span><span data-index=10></span><span data-index=11></span><span data-index=12></span></div></div><div class=text-info><div class=top><h3 class=content-title>Complete Memory</h3></div><div class="text body-default">A heavily stylized anamorphic flare with bold blue streaks and cinematic sci-fi energy. Reminiscent of classic Panavision C-Series optics, with creative liberties taken for dramatic storytelling.</div></div></div><div class=swiper-slide><div class=image-block><div id=containerMir20 class=twentytwenty-container><img data-title=Before data-content=Before src=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/v1779131872/mir-after_cvzx1b.webp class=first>
<img data-title=After data-content=After src=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/v1779131872/mir-before_kgz7kr.webp></div><div class=optics-gallery-features-arrow><div class=swiper-button-prev aria-label="Previous slide"><svg width="40" height="41" viewBox="0 0 40 41" fill="none"><rect width="40" height="40" rx="20" fill="#000" fill-opacity=".65"/><g clip-path="url(#clip0_22467_21493)"><path d="M24.6205 11.0916c-.489999999999998-.4945-1.28-.4945-1.77.0l-8.31 8.3862C14.1505 19.8714 14.1505 20.5072 14.5405 20.9007l8.31 8.3863C23.3405 29.7815 24.1305 29.7815 24.6205 29.287 25.1105 28.7925 25.1105 27.9952 24.6205 27.5008l-7.24-7.3166 7.25-7.3165C25.1105 12.3833 25.1105 11.576 24.6205 11.0916z" fill="#fff" fill-opacity=".6"/></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_22467_21493"><rect width="24" height="24.2202" fill="#fff" transform="translate(8 8.07422)"/></clipPath></defs></svg></div><div class=swiper-button-next aria-label="Next slide"><svg width="40" height="41" viewBox="0 0 40 41" fill="none"><rect width="40" height="40" rx="20" transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 40 0)" fill="#000" fill-opacity=".65"/><g clip-path="url(#clip0_22467_21500)"><path d="M15.3795 11.0916c.49-.4945 1.28-.4945 1.77.0l8.31 8.3862C25.8495 19.8714 25.8495 20.5072 25.4595 20.9007l-8.31 8.3863C16.6595 29.7815 15.8695 29.7815 15.3795 29.287c-.49-.494499999999999-.49-1.2918.0-1.7863l7.24-7.3165-7.25-7.3165C14.8895 12.3833 14.8895 11.576 15.3795 11.0916z" fill="#fff" fill-opacity=".6"/></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_22467_21500"><rect width="24" height="24.2202" fill="#fff" transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 32 8.07422)"/></clipPath></defs></svg></div></div><div class=optics-pagination><span data-index=0></span><span data-index=1></span><span class=active data-index=2></span><span data-index=3></span><span data-index=4></span><span data-index=5></span><span data-index=6></span><span data-index=7></span><span data-index=8></span><span data-index=9></span><span data-index=10></span><span data-index=11></span><span data-index=12></span></div></div><div class=text-info><div class=top><h3 class=content-title>Mir-20 20mm f3.5</h3></div><div class="text body-default">Drawing from the vintage Soviet wide-angle lens design, this flare produces warm tones, dramatic light rays, and expressive optical bloom with a classic analog feel.</div></div></div><div class=swiper-slide><div class=image-block><div id=containerCanonFD class=twentytwenty-container><img data-title=Before data-content=Before src=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/v1779131872/canon-after_qfsnn3.webp class=first>
<img data-title=After data-content=After src=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/v1779131872/canon-before_mlpdk9.webp></div><div class=optics-gallery-features-arrow><div class=swiper-button-prev aria-label="Previous slide"><svg width="40" height="41" viewBox="0 0 40 41" fill="none"><rect width="40" height="40" rx="20" fill="#000" fill-opacity=".65"/><g clip-path="url(#clip0_22467_21493)"><path d="M24.6205 11.0916c-.489999999999998-.4945-1.28-.4945-1.77.0l-8.31 8.3862C14.1505 19.8714 14.1505 20.5072 14.5405 20.9007l8.31 8.3863C23.3405 29.7815 24.1305 29.7815 24.6205 29.287 25.1105 28.7925 25.1105 27.9952 24.6205 27.5008l-7.24-7.3166 7.25-7.3165C25.1105 12.3833 25.1105 11.576 24.6205 11.0916z" fill="#fff" fill-opacity=".6"/></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_22467_21493"><rect width="24" height="24.2202" fill="#fff" transform="translate(8 8.07422)"/></clipPath></defs></svg></div><div class=swiper-button-next aria-label="Next slide"><svg width="40" height="41" viewBox="0 0 40 41" fill="none"><rect width="40" height="40" rx="20" transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 40 0)" fill="#000" fill-opacity=".65"/><g clip-path="url(#clip0_22467_21500)"><path d="M15.3795 11.0916c.49-.4945 1.28-.4945 1.77.0l8.31 8.3862C25.8495 19.8714 25.8495 20.5072 25.4595 20.9007l-8.31 8.3863C16.6595 29.7815 15.8695 29.7815 15.3795 29.287c-.49-.494499999999999-.49-1.2918.0-1.7863l7.24-7.3165-7.25-7.3165C14.8895 12.3833 14.8895 11.576 15.3795 11.0916z" fill="#fff" fill-opacity=".6"/></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_22467_21500"><rect width="24" height="24.2202" fill="#fff" transform="matrix(-1 0 0 1 32 8.07422)"/></clipPath></defs></svg></div></div><div class=optics-pagination><span data-index=0></span><span data-index=1></span><span data-index=2></span><span class=active data-index=3></span><span data-index=4></span><span data-index=5></span><span data-index=6></span><span data-index=7></span><span data-index=8></span><span data-index=9></span><span data-index=10></span><span data-index=11></span><span data-index=12></span></div></div><div class=text-info><div class=top><h3 class=content-title>Canon FD 35-105mm ZOOM 50mm T4</h3></div><div class="text body-default">Based on the classic 1981 Canon FD zoom lens, this colorful spherical flare delivers vivid optical elements, rich gold highlights, and retro purple streaking with a beautifully vintage character.</div></div></div><div class=swiper-slide><div class=image-block><div id=containerTribe7 class=twentytwenty-container><img data-title=Before data-content=Before src=https://borisfx-com-res.cloudinary.com/image/upload/v1779131872/tribe7-after_vw65za.webp class=first>
